          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "War! Such swollen arrogance in that man of Marutha country. Though he knows we have armies like the waves of the sea, the fool has dared to enter the battlefield! Prince! Let the preparations for war begin today. Let the weapons and materiel of war be renewed.",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "`கபோதி` is rendered as the insult `fool`; the exact Tamil remains upstream."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
